desc: Change 'foo' to 'bar' on every line
category: ex
par: 12
hint1: Global substitution is your friend
hint2: :%s — no g flag needed when there's one match per line
solution: :%s/foo/bar<CR>
note: :%s substitutes on every line (%); swaps the first 'foo' per line for 'bar'.
--- START ---
the foo is here
foo again
one more foo
--- GOAL ---
the bar is here
bar again
one more bar
--- END ---
